{pad:meta title='Every PAD tag'/}
<section class="hero">
  <h1>PAD tags and subsystem kinds</h1>
  <p class="lead">A page for each tag of PAD, named with its type prefix - every built-in tag,
  <code>&#123;pad:if&#125;</code>, every kind of the subsystems, <code>&#123;chart:pie&#125;</code>,
  <code>&#123;toy:life&#125;</code>, <code>&#123;icon:star&#125;</code>, and every sequence type,
  <code>&#123;sequence:fibonacci&#125;</code>: what it does in one line, its syntax and the
  options that belong to it, a longer description and live examples - every result rendered by
  the tag it documents. The catalogue also covers every kind selected through options and helpers: formats, validation rules, providers, channels, filters, map views, calendars, languages, formulas, themes and palettes. Find an entry by name, group, form or option, or search for it.</p>
  <ul class="stats">
    <li><b>{$tagsCount}</b> tags and kinds</li>
    <li><b>{$tagsGroupCnt}</b> groups</li>
    <li><b>{$exampleCount}</b> examples</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<div class="cards">
  {array:indexes}
  <a class="card" href="?{$page}">
    <h2>{$label}</h2>
    <p>{$text}</p>
  </a>
  {/array:indexes}
</div>

<h2>The groups</h2>
<div class="cards">
  {array:groups}
  <section class="card">
    <h3><a href="?groups#{$key}">{$label}</a> <span class="count">{$count}</span></h3>
    <p>{$tagline}</p>
    <div class="tagcloud">{array:tags}<a href="?{$link}" title="{$about}">{$label}</a>{/array:tags}</div>
  </section>
  {/array:groups}
</div>
